      "body": "\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7f39797-7f56-47d2-aca3-2274c9a6258f)\r\n\r\n### Checklist Before Starting\r\n- [x] Search for similar PR(s).\r\n\r\n### What does this PR do?\r\nFix progress bar calculation in `examples/sft/gsm8k/run_qwen_05_sp2.sh` training script to prevent unexpected training stops.\r\n\r\n### High-Level Design\r\nThis PR addresses the incorrect calculation of `steps_per_epoch` which was causing training to appear to stop unexpectedly and generating unwanted warning messages.\r\n\r\n### Specific Changes\r\n1. Fixed the logic for calculating `steps_per_epoch` and `last_epoch_steps`\r\n2. Added proper warning message handling\r\n3. Improved progress bar visualization\r\n4. Updated the training loop to handle step counts correctly\r\n\r\n### API\r\nNo API changes. This is a bug fix for existing functionality.\r\n\r\n### Usage Example\r\nThe script can be used as before, but now with correct progress indication:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nbash examples/sft/gsm8k/run_qwen_05_sp2.sh\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Test\r\nThe fix has been verified by:\r\n1. Running complete training cycles\r\n2. Confirming progress bar shows correct progress\r\n3. Verifying warning messages are properly handled\r\n\r\n### Additional Info.\r\n- **Issue Number**: N/A \r\n- **Training**: FSDP\r\n- **Inference**: None\r\n\r\n### Checklist Before Submitting\r\n- [x] Read the Contribute Guide\r\n- [x] Apply pre-commit checks\r\n- [ ] Add [BREAKING] to PR title (Not needed)\r\n- [ ] Update documentation (Not needed - bug fix)\r\n- [x] New CI unit test(s) added\r\n- [x] Rely on existing unit tests on CI",
